:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7CjkB0c1IuulrVNm5eYfm1KyYBk.jpg"},{"id":2405532,"name":"Fox Lee","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e69GkIrIQZeHJDfKzE7WjFOnkat.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"The Rope Curse 2","overview":"Dopo che un rituale di purificazione fallisce, un tormentato prete taoista cerca di aiutare una giovane sensitiva introversa la cui zia è posseduta da un potente demone."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Rope Curse 2","overview":"Jia-min, who was born sensitive to the paranormal, tries to summon \"Yi-A-Gu\" with two streamers. Huo-ge helps Jia-min subdue the spirit when the situation goes out of hand. Huo-ge possesses supernatural powers but lost his will to exorcise demons during a battle with the Thai Demon five years ago. As the wave of suicides continues, the village is thrown into chaos. Another battle is about to begin."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"粽邪2：馗降","overview":"《馗降：粽邪2》延续第一集宫庙民俗的侧写，将镜头伸向传统送肉粽仪式中最重要的桥段—跳锺馗，通常会由事主家属聘请专门的法师扮演锺馗，将上吊亡灵的怨气送到海口祭吊煞，以达到驱邪避凶之效。本片锺馗便由影帝饰演，李康生在剧中的角色自幼带有天命能见阴阳，他却因此命运多舛，所幸由雷洪饰演的金龙师点化开悟，成为锺馗身为民除煞。然而他的命运却没有从此一帆风顺……  　　今年因为疫情肆虐，戏院排片也饱受影响，目前《馗降：粽邪2》仍定档今年农曆七月，希望鬼门大开之时，藉由鬼王出巡的气势，为大家驱疫除害。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p1ms0vDzh2XPdGVCKrCQ6sHnubR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ovgd6CZxQbRtTGwxk6oYbr7haDA.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":737519,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"zh":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p1ms0vDzh2XPdGVCKrCQ6sHnubR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p1ms0vDzh2XPdGVCKrCQ6sHnubR.jpg","language":"zh","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url"